depends append
send 1
c select INBOX
receive 9
* OK [CLOSED] I, missa est
* 4 EXISTS
* 0 RECENT
* OK [UIDNEXT 5] next uid
* FLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen)
* OK [PERMANENTFLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen \*)] permanent flags
* OK [UIDVALIDITY 1] uid validity
* OK [MAILBOXID (f...)] stable mailbox ID
c OK [READ-WRITE] done
send 1
d fetch 3:4 (internaldate rfc822.size)
receive 3
* 3 FETCH (RFC822.SIZE 128 INTERNALDATE "12-Feb-2005 10:13:14 +0000")
* 4 FETCH (RFC822.SIZE 127 INTERNALDATE "09-Feb-2002 10:13:14 +0000")
d OK done
end
